# Cloudflare Pages SPA history fallback.
#
# Per-route static HTML (dist/swap/index.html, dist/impressum/index.html, …)
# generated by scripts/generate-static-routes.mjs is served first when it
# exists, so social-card crawlers see the right OG meta tags. For any other
# path, serve dist/index.html with a 200 (NOT a 301/302) so the SPA can run
# the router and decide what to render.
/*  /index.html  200
